## 44. Family 4 regression boundary

Business settings routes, focused settings headers, dirty-form/save behavior, and business-hours adapters remain unchanged. Reuse only generic focus/stale primitives where semantics match.

## 45. Family 5 regression boundary

Customer notifications, profile, account menu, navbar behavior, and notification preferences remain unchanged. Family 2 may use customer shell behavior but cannot alter notification routing or account semantics.

## 46. Family 6 regression boundary

